Package: bayesglm2
Type: Package
Title: A From-Scratch Bayesian Generalized Linear Model Engine
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-11-19
Authors@R: c(person("Yu-Sung", "Su", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "suyusung@tsinghua.edu.cn",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5021-8209")))
Author: Yu-Sung Su [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yu-Sung Su <suyusung@tsinghua.edu.cn>
Description: A rewrite of arm's bayesglm that does not build on glm() or
    glm.fit().  The design-matrix layer (model.matrixBayes and the
    contr.bayes.* contrast generators) is written clean and stands on its
    own; the penalized-IRLS engine and its C core follow.
